Regalia - Native Library License Notice
========================================

CURRENT STATUS (v1.2.3 round-50 rewrite)
----------------------------------------
This directory previously shipped three prebuilt shared libraries
(.so files). They were DELETED from the git tree in v1.2.3 round-48
(SEC-2): the root-level lib/ directory is NOT the Gradle packaging
path, so nothing in the build ever read these copies.

The real build-time location of the native libraries is:

    src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/

That directory is populated at build time (Stockfish engine binary
download + NDK build of the JNI bridge) and is NOT committed to the
source tree (see BUILDING.md for the exact steps and SHA-256 checks).

License texts and attribution for the native components live at the
repository root:
  - LICENSE-GPL v3      — libstockfish.so and libengine_bridge.so
  - LICENSE-Apache v2.0 — libc++_shared.so (Apache v2.0 with LLVM
                          Exception; see also https://llvm.org/LICENSE.txt)
  - NOTICE              — overall attribution and per-file classification
  - AUTHORS-stockfish   — Stockfish project authors list

========================================================================
HISTORICAL RECORD — the file bodies are NOT in the git tree
========================================================================
The sections below are retained as a historical record of the license
classification of the three .so files as they existed here before the
round-48 (SEC-2) deletion. The classifications still describe the
corresponding build artifacts packaged inside the APK, but the prebuilt
files themselves are no longer present in this directory or anywhere
else in the git tree.

