========================================================================
Size     : ~1.29 MB
Origin   : Android NDK — LLVM libc++ C++ Standard Library runtime
License  : Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exception
Copyright: LLVM Project, University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign
Source   : https://android.googlesource.com/platform/ndk/
