========================================================================
2. libengine_bridge.so
========================================================================
Size     : ~15 KB
Origin   : Regalia project — Engine JNI Bridge
License  : GNU General Public License v3 (GPL v3)
Copyright: (C) 2026 Regalia
           DroidFish-derived parts: (C) 2011-2014 Peter Österlund
Source   : src/main/cpp/engine_jni.cpp

This library is the JNI bridge between the Java layer and the UCI chess
engine. Its native code is derived from DroidFish (nativeutil.cpp by
Peter Österlund). As of v1.2.3 round-48 the source retains only the
nativeChmod implementation (the nativeRenice orphan implementation was
deleted in round-48, RED-3).

Full license text: LICENSE-GPL v3 (at the repository root)

